'''St. Pigge the 2nd''' (エリザベス2世, ''Erizabesu 2-sei'', '''Elizabeth II''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. She was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = St. Pigge the 2nd
|image = E 048.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Melancholy Damp|Sub-chapter 1 - Melancholy Damp]]<br>'''CotC''': [[Crimson Star (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 2 - Crimson Star]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[A Life of Antithesis|Sub-chapter 9 - A Life of Antithesis]]
}}

==Enemy==
St. Pigge the 2nd is a supersized version of the original [[Pigge]] that wears a fancy crown on her head. She has more knockbacks, faster attacks and high health. When buffed, she can be quite the threat.

==Strategy==
She can be slightly difficult without [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] or [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]], since her damage will simply overwhelm lower-ranged units and [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]]. Having anti-Red units that can consistently hit and damage her like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe]] will definitely make her easier to handle, especially in the presence of stronger threats that can get in the way. Later on, basically anything is usable against her, as she just becomes another generic money-drop peon except in stages where she is massively buffed, such as [[Leadfoot Drive]] and [[Holiday Atonement]].

